The more damaging of Krauser's supers, Gigantic Cyclone is also used as a reversal. You can combo into it from some juggles as well, and is generally your preferred ender when available due to its damage and okizeme. Notably, though, it is no longer a grab in contrast to its past appearances. 

In the current version of the game, Gigantic Cyclone comes with massive caveats. You cannot combo into it on the ground, and when used as a reversal, it loses to grounded, throw-invincible moves such as most Low Dodge Attacks. However, it can still hit airborne opponents just fine. 
