Krauser's Hidden Gear is his best combo ender and a good reversal that does what Gigantic Cyclone cannot. It's great for closing out rounds, using as a reversal, maximizing your damage, instantly escaping Overheat via resetting your REV gauge, or punishing some -6 attacks that are otherwise safe. 

Due to its lack of okizeme in comparison to Kaiser Wave or Gigantic Cyclone, it may be better to not immediately resort to Hidden Gear and instead use one of your basic supers to keep your momentum. This is especially important when you need to make a comeback. Resetting to neutral as Krauser isn't too bad a move, either, though. 
